{"id":"416909","name":"毛菜南瓜汤圆","author":"花擦擦","authorId":"1492203","desc":"","cover":"images/416909/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"糯米粉","amount":"150克"},{"name":"南瓜泥","amount":"100克"},{"name":"鸡毛菜","amount":"100克"}],"sub":[{"name":"油","amount":"适量"},{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"},{"name":"味精","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"鸡毛菜洗净。","img":"images/416909/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"起油锅加热，放入鸡毛菜煸炒炒透出锅备用。","img":"images/416909/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"南瓜泥放入糯米粉中拌匀。","img":"images/416909/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"揉成光滑的面团。","img":"images/416909/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"取一面团搓成小圆子。","img":"images/416909/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"锅中放水煮开，放入圆子煮，煮至上浮。","img":"images/416909/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放入鸡毛菜煮开。","img":"images/416909/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"放入适量的盐煮开。","img":"images/416909/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"最后放入适量的味精即可。","img":"images/416909/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/416909/step_10.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}